	<cmns-doc:ReferenceDocument rdf:about="&cas-ref;VDA-4951">
		<dc:title xml:lang="en">Datenfernübertragung von CAD/CAM Daten</dc:title>
		<dc:title xml:lang="de">The non-binding VDA Recommendation 4951 describes agreements regarding procedures, formats and contents of files, which standardize the exchange of CAD/CAM data and the associated administrative information and thus make it reliable and secure.  Due to the large number of topics in the field of CAD/CAM data exchange, the recommendation is divided into individual sub-documents, each of which is dedicated to one topic, but some of which also refer to or build on each other.  The numbering of the sub-documents does not indicate any context or a priority, it is simply historical.</dc:title>
	</cmns-doc:ReferenceDocument>
	
